       \"proofreaders\": [\r\n          \"奥山裕子（ナビーラ）\",\r\n          \"佐藤純子（ファーティマ）\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"proof\": \"Actual Japanese publisher序言PDFindex5; main selected2026text remains separately creditedサイード佐藤.\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"edition\": \"1440AH; actual printed end matter PDFindex1403.2019-11-16 is catalog date, not assumed Gregorian imprint.\",\r\n      \"scope\": \"Separate underlying publication; currentQuranEnc grant not automatically asserted for its glossary. Exact facts retained for independent review.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"application\": \"Exact bounded published quotations are retained with complete contextual parents, all relevant notes, honest credits/version and genuine conditions. Unknown excerpt scope is retained as unknown, not absence, automatic ban or blanket clearance. No universal pre-reuse contact deadline, invented quota/accreditation or waived duty. No contact was sent; source note-reporting/update obligations are not claimed completed.\"\r\n}\r\n",
