          "path": "assets/learning/essential-source949/ja/SOURCE-FACTS949.json",
          "text": "{\r\n  \"unit\": \"essential-01-001\",\r\n  \"facts\": {\r\n    \"TokyoNotes\": \"55:7 note1 remains at its actual printed anchor although it concerns human expression;55:8 note2 retained.28:24/12:87 decorative page ornaments are not missing prose or scripture words.\",\r\n    \"TokyoExcerpts\": \"Three exact continuous excerpts end before inherited closing dialogue punctuation outside their actual displayed span. Complete unchanged parents supplied.\",\r\n    \"Sato21_47\": \"Actual printed current note38 and API say 地雷章; retained unchanged, not repaired to地震章.\",\r\n    \"SatoGlossary\": \"Actual1440AH imprint,2019-11-16 catalogue date, translator佐藤裕一 and proofreaders奥山裕子/佐藤純子 distinct from current2026 verse publication. All14 full entries and notes retained; weak/attributed-grade qualifications remain source statements.\",\r\n    \"published68\": \"Full parent retains actual preceding 告め. Chosen excerpt begins later and uses 大地程 twice; no publisher wording repaired.\",\r\n    \"fullPrimary51_95\": \"Correct full classical Arabic for771 and2679a retained. Empty text and wrong-language editorial pointers are not asserted as corroboration.\",\r\n    \"sourceTerms\": \"Actual credits, complete relevant notes and source-specific conditions travel with the text. Unknown cumulative/excerpt permissions and edition relationship remain unknown; no legal certificate or fulfilled reporting duty is claimed.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"presentation\": \"Detailed reference/variant/edition records stay here; the ordinary reading uses concise book names and short translation credits. No reference images, raw captures, working history or methods are in this text payload.\"\r\n}\r\n",
